[27026,52.9,1976,47,88,26],[27027,43.6,1976,46,87,25],[27028,42.5,1976,51,85,26],[27326,52.2,2013,50,82,26]],"links":[["Josephine County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/oregon/josephine-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 17 grids runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and July to August came in under 90% of normal in 44 of them. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 17% of normal in June to July and 36% in May to June. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 52% and May to June at 35% on the middle of the grids. Grid 26126 had its driest year in 2013 at 40%.</p>"}
